Description: Small postgreSQL package to convert equatorial coordinates to galactic and back. The low-lelve conversion code itself is taken wcstools.

Functions provided are 

* gal2fk5ra(real, real)

* gal2fk5dec(real, real)

* fk52gall(real, real)

* fk52galb(real, real)   

which convert from IAU 1958 Galactic coordinates into J2000 FK5 coordiantes
and back. All inputs are in decimal degrees